{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52544","headline":"其三 · 陈元光","name":"其三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤征东岭表，[冒]（胃）雨一登临。\n再拜烟雾霁，羣峰奎璧森。\n独山峰耸阁，中谷水鸣琴。\n明山卉木翳，遥林云雾深。\n瞻庙开明贶，平辽断秽祲。\n神颫号万籁，列宿献千禽。\n树尾扬旌帛，山头镟革金。\n葵阳烘固介，华露润华簪。\n鼎立峥嵘势，钟闻杳霭阴。\n绾荷据口勾，掬水洗怀襟。\n瀑石流觞咏，丰碑驻马吟。\n三山香火地，万古帝王钦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}